Calendar entry pulse implementation and test suite are landed for Section 5.

Past days on the Recognition Calendar now execute a single subtle entry pulse on mount, staggered by 60ms per day index and settling within 2.5 seconds. The animation strictly respects reduced motion media preferences and stillness state overrides, leaving existing shimmers and cell layouts untouched.

